# i18n & UI

## i18n

- Strings in `shared/i18n/ar.js` and `en.js` — add **both** languages for every new key
- Use `t("key")` — never hardcode user-facing Arabic/English in JS unless in `sample-plans.js` content
- RTL: `document.documentElement.dir = "ar" ? "rtl" : "ltr"` (handled in `applyI18n`)

Common keys: `search.*`, `plan.*`, `gemini.*`, `template.*`, `demo.*`

## HTML

- Search form: `#city-input` (required), `#btn-search`, `#results-section`
- Plan page boot: `js/plan-detail-page.js` only — keep `plan.html` minimal
- Cache-bust script/css: `?v=N` on `index.html` and `plan.html`

## CSS

- Governorate colors: `data/destination-colors.js` → hero/card gradients
- Image placeholders: `.image-placeholder`, `.image-placeholder-grid` — dashed box + caption, no `<img src="http...">`
- Plan cards: `.plan-card-hero-color` (no photos)

## UX priorities (from product)

1. Search button must work reliably
2. Results must use **exact typed destination** (`city_name`)
3. Plan detail must never be blank
